Package: elicitcausal
Type: Package
Title: Elicit Conditional Probability Tables from Causal DAGs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Robert", "Kubinec", email = "rmk7@nyu.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Accepts a causal DAG in dagitty format and interactively elicits
    conditional probability distributions from users. Assumes all nodes are
    binary (0/1) variables. Users provide probabilities (or Likert-scale
    ratings) for each parent combination of every node. Computes the full
    joint distribution via the chain rule of probability and reports Shannon
    entropy. Supports querying marginal and conditional distributions from
    the elicited model.
